    "body": "I have recently moved to neovim 8.0 and was testing if all plugins are working. I wasn't testing ident.nvim particularly but this peculiar case appeared.\r\n\r\nI have seen this as of now with only help text in neovim\r\nMay be something to do with source text not following proper indentation.\r\n\r\nIts happening both on stable and default branch\r\n\r\nhttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/11389059/195303131-d32467da-8cff-4729-8534-f52cd7e1ccec.mov\r\n\r\n",
