            "body": "> if this is specific treesitter issue then running TSUpdate should fix it?\r\n\r\nSo updating 'nvim-treesitter' plugin and then running `:TSUpdate` did improve whitespace situation, but not completely. For now, I personally will disable tree-sitter highlighting in 'help' files via using `highlight = { enable = true, disable = { 'help' } }` in `require('nvim-treesitter.configs').setup()` call.",
